WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
In a shop, there are two
boxes of the same cereal.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.150
The small box holds four hundred
grams and costs two pounds.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.990
The big box holds seven hundred
and fifty grams and costs four

4
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.150
pounds.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.450
Lots of people grab the big box.

6
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.970
Is bigger always better value?

7
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.490
In this mission, you'll use
speed, distance and time,

8
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.940
and work out how fast
a car or a runner goes.

9
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.670
You'll meet density, which links
the mass of an object to its

10
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.570
volume.

11
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.310
And you'll compare prices
to find the best value.

12
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.710
Your mission: decide which
box of cereal is better value.
